  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ArenaHintZone
  title: S2-B  COMPARE
  body: 'First TAP or HOLD left-click: troops stop at the crates and the enemy. Hold
    RIGHT-click to recall. Now SWEEP through the same objects.

    EXPECT: dispatch
    stops at things, sweep ignores them. DELAYED ROUTE: hold Ctrl, move the cursor
    to where the route starts, hold LEFT + RIGHT to draw it, release Ctrl to save
    it (the line turns green). Later, tap Ctrl to send the troops along it, even
    if they are fighting.'
  radius: 3
