  title: S2-A  SWEEP IGNORES THINGS
  body: 'FIRST hold left-click to send the troops out. THEN hold LEFT + RIGHT mouse
    together and move the mouse through the crates and the enemy.

    EXPECT: troops
    follow the cursor and do NOT stop for anything on the way. After you release
    they may pick a nearby target. That is normal. A white ring around you shows
    your sweep range.'
  radius: 3
